<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Kakinada cargoes - Feb 11.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Kakinada cargoes - Feb 11.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Kakinada port on February 11,1997:</p>
<p>  Commodity		Tons		Ship/Name	 Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD)(Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Fertilisers</p>
<p> Urea		21,893 (ULD)   9,607  M.V.Pratishtha	29/01</p>
<p> Urea		 1,015 (ULD)  12,679  M.V.Pericles	  09/02</p>
<p>Food Grains</p>
<p> Wheat		8,585 (ULD)   1,415  M.V.Raja Mahendra   31/01</p>
<p>Agricultural</p>
<p>  Products	 11,016 (LDD)     484  M.V.Feng Ge	   26/01</p>
<p>Agricultural</p>
<p>  Products	  3,591 (LDD)   8,409  M.V.Navira Express  08/02</p>
<p>Agricultural</p>
<p>  Products	  1,204 (LDD)  10,296  M.V.Da Feng	   09/02</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Note:</p>
